            </note>
            <note corresp="#d142-f2" n="2" xml:id="d142-f2-content">
                <p>Luís Fiore and Carlos A. Adrogué successively headed the Argentine governmental
                    agency having oversight of Axis companies, the Junta de Vigilancia.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
